{"4446310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Treasure Hunt - Kids", "steam_appid": 4446310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for a magical adventure full of puzzles and hidden treasures!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exciting interactive treasure hunt through mysterious locations. Along your journey, you’ll meet unique guardians – charming mythical creatures who will challenge your knowledge and problem-solving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At each waypoint, you’ll face tricky questions and fun mini-games. Only by solving these challenges can you move forward and get closer to the hidden treasure. Do you have what it takes to complete the quest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you can expect:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 📍 <strong>An interactive treasure hunt</strong> with multiple waypoints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Fun mini puzzles</strong> and varied challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧚 <strong>Lovingly designed guardians</strong> with voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 <strong>Immersive sound effects</strong> for a magical atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Adjustable difficulty levels</strong> – perfect for kids and families</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ <strong>A magical treasure map</strong> to guide your journey</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play on your own, explore with friends, or go on an adventure with your family – this game offers fun, excitement, and plenty of surprises for young explorers and the young at heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the challenges, collect clues, and discover the treasure!</strong><br>Are you ready for your adventure? Then let’s go! 🏴‍☠️✨</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for a magical adventure f